{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 26, :comments ["<b>On the very day, this one.</b> On which HaShem spoke with him about this matter." "<b>Avraham was circumcised.</b> It was Yom HaKippurim — a gezerah shavah of עצם־עצם. And why was he not circumcised from the hour he recognized his Creator? So as not to lock the door before converts, that they not say: as soon as he came to Him He caused him pain. And why from the Covenant Between the Pieces? So that Yitzchak would emerge from a fit and holy drop."], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 17, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:04:32.713371525Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}